.TH XD\-ADMINTOOLS 1 2026-10-18 XeonDesktop "XeonDesktop Manual"
.SH NAME
xd\-admintools \- the Administrative Tools folder
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY xd\-admintools
.YS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xd\-admintools
is Windows XP's Administrative Tools folder (Control Panel > Performance
and Maintenance): shortcuts to the system tools, each a program of its
own: Services
.RB ( xd\-services (1)),
Event Viewer
.RB ( xd\-eventvwr (1)),
Disk Management
.RB ( xd\-diskmgmt (1))
and Device Manager
.RB ( "xd\-sysdm \-\-devmgr" ).
.PP
A tool is listed when its desktop entry has
.BR X\-XeonDesktop\-AdminTool=true .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xd\-control (1),
.BR xd\-sysdm (1)
